> camxes-exp and zantufa.
>

=20

La zantufa does not allow full connective system to sumtcita, FA,=20
NOI/GOI-clauses=20
(not to a pseudo-termset like {ke baiku naku ke'e}, either : this ke-clause=
=20
is unnecessary for la zantufa connective system, but implemented only for=
=20
parsing official texts including {nu'i} and the similar.)=20

The reason varies. As for sumtcita, it is because the forethought=20
connectives include sumtcita in their structure itself, for example {ba gi=
=20
... gi ...}. {ge puku gi ca(ku)} is parsed by la zantufa because it is=20
connection of terms.

